From 2ae0242f2bacf46446af1c2276111f2d953a0255 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pokeheartgold-3ds-bootstrap <bootstrap@invalid>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 17:18:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Use the port headers' types for the SDK functions the files
 redeclare

Eight game files repeat SDK prototypes locally with types that differ from
the header the port's <nitro.h> already includes. MWCC allowed the duplicate
because the two declarations were never in one translation unit, or because
its enums and pointer types were compatible enough; GCC rejects them with
"conflicting types":

  agb_cartridge.c:20    int CTRDG_IdentifyAgbBackup(int) vs u16 (...,
                        CTRDGBackupType) in nitro/ctrdg.h
  pokewalker_ir.c:17    int MI_CompressLZImpl(const void *, u32, void *, int)
                        vs u32 (...) in nitro/mi/compress.h
  pokewalker_ir.c:21/22 int RTC_GetTime/RTC_GetDate vs RTCResult (...) in
                        nitro/rtc/ARM9/api.h
  pokewalker_link.c:46  void RTC_GetDateTime vs RTCResult in the same header
  game_stats_request.c:7 int strncmp(const char *, const char *, u32) vs
                        size_t (a different type from u32 on the host)
  lobby_tree_nodes.c:10 char * vs const char * in lib/include/assert.h
  save_fashion.c:82/83  u32 *table vs MATHCRC32Table * in nitro/math/crc.h;
                        the calls at :548/:549 and :553/:554 pass the array,
                        which is the same 256-word object (cast there)
  screen_fade_effects.c:25/1169 static inline int GX_IsHBlank vs the compat
                        header's s32 form (same DISPSTAT read)
  wifi_setup_app.c:15   int brightness vs s32 in nitro/gx/gx.h

Under SDK_PORT_3DS keep only the header declaration (or, for save_fashion's
local array, cast at the four calls); the #else keeps the original text, so
the MWCC build is unchanged. gcc-10 -E -P without SDK_PORT_3DS is
byte-identical for all eight files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/application/main_menu/agb_cartridge.c    |  4 ++++
 src/application/pokewalker/pokewalker_ir.c   | 12 ++++++++++++
